\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \uc0\u55356 \u57252  Live Demonstration Script \'96 Clinic File Reminder App\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 \uc0\u55357 \u57321  Opening (30 seconds)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \'93Hi everyone \'97 I\'92ll now show you how my project, the 
\f2\i Clinic File Reminder App
\f1\i0 , works in real time.\uc0\u8232 It\'92s designed to help clinics know exactly when to shred old 
\f0\b physical
\f1\b0  patient files, based on two rules:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 3+ years since the patient\'92s 
\f0\b death
\f1\b0 , or\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 7+ years since their 
\f0\b last visit
\f1\b0 .\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 \uc0\u55357 \u56770 \u65039  Step 1: Launch the App\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\i\b0\fs24 \cf0 (Double-click or run 
\f3\fs26 gui_app.py
\f2\fs24 )
\f1\i0 \uc0\u8232 \'93This opens up the main window. Here you\'92ll see two tabs:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 One for 
\f0\b Active Patients
\f1\b0 , and\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 One for 
\f0\b Inactive Patients
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 Active means the file still needs to be kept. Inactive means it\'92s ready to be shredded.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 \uc0\u10133  Step 2: Add a New Patient\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\i\b0\fs24 \cf0 (Click the \'93Add Patient\'94 button)
\f1\i0 \uc0\u8232 \'93I can add a new patient manually. Let\'92s say I enter:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 First name: 
\f2\i John
\f1\i0 \
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Last name: 
\f2\i Smith
\f1\i0 \
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Last visit: 
\f2\i 2015-04-10
\f1\i0 \
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Death date: 
\f2\i blank
\f1\i0 \uc0\u8232 That means John is still alive but hasn\'92t visited in over 7 years.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\i \cf0 (Click Submit)
\f1\i0 \uc0\u8232 \'93Now John appears in the 
\f0\b Active Patients
\f1\b0  list, but the reminder logic hasn\'92t run yet.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 \uc0\u55357 \u56548  Step 3: Upload a CSV (optional)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\i\b0\fs24 \cf0 (If you want to show this)
\f1\i0 \uc0\u8232 \'93I can also upload a CSV file with multiple patient records at once. This is great for large clinics.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 \uc0\u55357 \u56577  Step 4: Run Reminder Check\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\i\b0\fs24 \cf0 (Click the \'93Reminder Check\'94 button)
\f1\i0 \uc0\u8232 \'93This runs the logic. It checks every patient:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 If they\'92ve died 3+ years ago, or\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 If they haven\'92t visited in 7+ years\uc0\u8232 Then it marks them Inactive and writes a reminder.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 \uc0\u55357 \u56514  Step 5: Show Reminder File\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\i\b0\fs24 \cf0 (Open the most recent 
\f3\fs26 reminders_YYYYMMDD.txt
\f2\fs24  file)
\f1\i0 \uc0\u8232 \'93This file gets created automatically. Here\'92s an example line:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 John Smith \'97 7 years + X days since last visit on 2015-04-10\uc0\u8232 It tells staff that it\'92s time to shred that patient\'92s paper file.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 \uc0\u55357 \u56580  Step 6: Show Inactive Tab\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\i\b0\fs24 \cf0 (Switch to \'93Inactive Patients\'94 tab)
\f1\i0 \uc0\u8232 \'93As you can see, John is now listed here.\u8232 He\'92s still in the database, but flagged as Inactive \'97 we 
\f0\b never delete
\f1\b0  any records.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 \uc0\u55358 \u56800  Wrap-Up\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \'93So that\'92s the full loop:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 You add or upload patients\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Run a check\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Get a shredding reminder\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 And keep everything organized and safe.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'93This helps clinics 
\f0\b stay legally compliant
\f1\b0  while managing physical records efficiently.\uc0\u8232 Thanks for watching \'97 I\'92d be happy to answer any questions.\'94\
